								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<p>No one should should go hungry in Central Alabama.&nbsp; Our food pantries offer meal items and food staples to keep cabinets and cupboards full.&nbsp; If you are in need of food assistance in Birmingham, call <a href=\"tel: 205-328-2420\"> 205-328-2420</a>.&nbsp; If you are in need of food assistance in Bessemer, call <a href=\"tel: 205-425-4303\"> 205-425-4303</a>.&nbsp; If you are in need of food assistance in Shelby or Chilton counties, please call <a href=\"tel: 205-663-7105\"> 205-663-7105</a>.</p>",
